  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\left[F e F_{6}\\right]^{3-}\\) complex ion possesses sp \\(^{3} d^{2}\\) hybridization.\r\n\r\nThe electronic configurations of \\(C r, F e, C o\\) and \\(T i\\) in the complexes are \\((3 d)^{3},(3 d)^{5},(3 d)^{6}\\) and \\((3 d)^{1}\\), respectively.\r\n\r\nThese involve \\(d^{2} s p^{3}, s p^{3} d^{2}, d^{2} s p^{3}\\) and \\(d^{2} s p^{3}\\) hybridization respectively.",
